          "id": "t01-move",
          "title": "Move the element, its geometry and its unit tests",
          "descriptionMarkdown": "Copy RayX master `4ee806e9`'s `virtual_list/mod.rs` and `geometry.rs` to `crates/gpui/src/elements/virtual_list/`. Rename the types and functions as VL-1 lists, map `rayx_diagnostics` to `diagnostics`, and re-export the module from `elements/mod.rs`.\n\nKeep behaviour byte-for-byte; the fixes come later. The RayX-only `ScrollbarHandleBase` impl stays behind (task t11).\n\nMove the 26 unit tests. Write `crates/gpui/tests/virtual_list.rs` for VL-1's window-driven cases with fast mode off.\n\nCommit in gpux as `feat(gpui): add VirtualList, moved from RayX's VirtualListBase`, with the RayX source commit noted in the body.",
          "criterionIds": [
            "VL-1"
          ],
          "designIds": [
            "d-move",
            "d-proof"
          ],
          "dependsOn": [],
          "checkIds": [
            "c-vl-unit",
            "c-vl-element"
          ],
          "sourceRefs": [
            {
              "repositoryId": "rayx",
              "path": "crates/rayx_components/rayx_components_base/src/virtual_list/mod.rs"
            },
            {
              "repositoryId": "rayx",
              "path": "crates/rayx_components/rayx_components_base/src/virtual_list/geometry.rs"
            },
            {
              "repositoryId": "gpux",
              "path": "crates/gpui/src/elements/uniform_list.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
